    "created_at": "2015-09-23T07:05:23Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-09-23T07:05:23Z",
    "body": "Well, what I said in https://github.com/RByers/EventListenerOptions/issues/20#issuecomment-137699314 is that what touch events do today doesn't require any changes in DOM. What you are suggesting here is that they observe listeners, which is something we want to avoid.\n\nI don't really care where we settle on the design, but I'd like to settle on the design first. (I asked for the processing model before because the design wasn't clear. Now the processing model is clear, but the design seems wrong.)\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
